<td id="S6.T1.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="S6.T1.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4/5</span></td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="S6.T1.2.3.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">9/10</span></td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="S6.T1.2.3.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">7/10</span></td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.3.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="S6.T1.2.3.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">6/6</span></td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.3.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="S6.T1.2.3.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5/6</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S6.T1.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S6.T1.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="S6.T1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Ventura</span>-P</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">10/15</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">1/5</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">5/10</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.4.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">4/10</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.4.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">4/6</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.4.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">2/6</td></tr>
<tr id="S6.T1.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S6.T1.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">LeLaN <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bibx11" title="" class="ltx_ref">11</a>]</cite></td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">9/15</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">1/5</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">8/10</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.5.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">3/10</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.5.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">3/6</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.5.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">2/6</td></tr>
<tr id="S6.T1.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S6.T1.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Convoi <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bibx7" title="" class="ltx_ref">7</a>]</cite></td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">8/15</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">3/5</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">7/10</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.6.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="S6.T1.2.6.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">7/10</span></td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.6.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">4/6</td>
<td id="S6.T1.2.6.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">3/6</td></tr>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE I: </span><span id="S6.T1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Multi-task planning evaluations.</span> <span id="S6.T1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Ventura</span> consistently outperforms baselines across representative robot navigation tasks in seen and unseen environments. We define the success rate criteria for each task in Sec. <a href="#S7" title="VII Evaluation ‣ Ventura: Adapting Image Diffusion Models for Unified Task Conditioned Navigation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">VII</span></a>. Bolded numbers indicate the best performing method(s) for each category. We use the following abbreviations: Obs. - Obstacle, Obj. - Object, Ter. - Terrain, Uns. - Unseen, <span id="S6.T1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Ventura</span>-P - our approach without internet pre-training.</figcaption>
</figure>
